---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About BhujDeals | Editorial Integrity & Testing Standards"
  description="Learn how BhujDeals independently benchmarks consumer electronics, hotel deals, and software to help you discover the lowest verified prices."
>
  <div class="container">
    <Breadcrumbs crumbs={[{ label: "About BhujDeals" }]} />

    <div class="trust-page-header">
      <span class="badge badge-brand">OUR EDITORIAL CHARTER</span>
      <h1 class="page-title">We Cut Through the Marketing Noise</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        Founded by veteran hardware engineers and travel strategists, BhujDeals was created to solve a singular problem: online shopping discovery has become overwhelmed by fake reviews, hidden affiliate kickbacks, and price gouging.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="trust-content-grid">
      <div class="card pillar-card">
        <span class="pillar-icon">🔬</span>
        <h3>Laboratory Benchmarking</h3>
        <p>We test battery runtimes with photometers, measure CPU compiler heat with infrared thermal cameras, and independently audit hotel room booking checkout feeds.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card pillar-card">
        <span class="pillar-icon">💰</span>
        <h3>Zero Sponsored Placement Bias</h3>
        <p>No brand or hotelier can pay to jump to the top of our recommendation lists. If a product fails our stress testing, we state so plainly.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card pillar-card">
        <span class="pillar-icon">⚖️</span>
        <h3>Transparent Reader-Supported Model</h3>
        <p>We earn referral commissions when you click out to authorized merchants and make a purchase. This keeps our service free, with no intrusive paywalls.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card methodology-box">
      <h2>How We Test Products & Stays</h2>
      <div class="methodology-steps">
        <div class="step-row">
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Market Auditing & Selection</h4>
            <p>We survey consumer forums (Reddit, Twitter, consumer grievance boards) to identify real user pain points before choosing which 10–15 models to test head-to-head.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-row">
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Hands-on Testing Under Real Conditions</h4>
            <p>Laptops are subjected to intense daily coding workflows. Skincare products are evaluated by diverse skin types over 4 weeks. Hotels are mystery-shopped anonymously.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step-row">
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Continuous 24/7 Price Scraping</h4>
            <p>Our algorithms track prices across Amazon, Flipkart, Croma, and Booking.com every 15 minutes, ensuring deal tags and coupon codes are active and honest.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .trust-page-header {
    padding: 32px 0 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-default);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 12px 0 10px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .trust-content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .pillar-card {
    padding: 28px;
  }

  .pillar-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .pillar-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .pillar-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .methodology-box {
    padding: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    background: #f8fafc;
  }

  .methodology-box h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .methodology-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .step-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .step-num {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .step-row h4 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .step-row p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .trust-content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
